Triśiras begs Khara to grant him single combat --- Khara yields and watches as appointed witness --- Triśiras showers arrows roaring like wet drum --- Triśiras wounds Rāma forehead with three arrows --- Rāma pierces chest with fourteen snakelike shafts --- Rāma fells horses driver banner and pierces heart --- Rāma strikes three heads from leaping demon --- Khara rallies fugitives and charges Rāma